(b) Pro Tier (Valid Polar.sh License Key Required): Metal DIBR stereo
    synthesis, bidirectional MV-HEVC transcoding, live ScreenCaptureKit
    pipelines, and Pro MCP tools. Open-source builds compiled with
    -DOSS_EDITION unlock all features offline.

